there're probably spoilers here for some

interesting things from late in my game:

1) cursed bags of holding are really nasty.  Not only do they
INCREASE the weight of the items in them, items (based on the
code, i think just random items) will disappear.  I lost mjollnir
that way (still have excalibur, vorpal blade, and frost brand as 
a backup, so no big deal, but it was a drag...now i have to carry
a bow and arrows).  

Based on my perusal of the source, the items don't disappear until
you actually open the bag, so if you uncurse the bag before you
open it, you should be ok.  not sure of this; my c isn't what it
oughtta be, and i only looked for a little while, but this was 
pretty straightforward.  I'm now carrying a blessed scroll of remove
curse in a sack along with my wand of cancellation.  

2) cursed bell of opening is handy.  ringing it summons undead, mostly
zombies and...wraiths.  Munch, Munch.  level 23 -> level 30 in about 500
turns.  

3) spellbook of create familiar is great.  Not a bad idea for a wish 
later in the game, once you've got good armor and weapon (and any quest
items you can get).  in case you're not sure (i wasn't) it creates a 
pet for you.  I presume it just does a "create monster" but makes it
tame, so doing it on a low level of the dungeon will give you a handy 
pet (first time i tried i got a white dragon).  As you might imagine
this is a high-level spell, so make sure you have that +5 helm of
brilliance... ;)

so anyway, i have the bell, book, and candelabrum.   i haven't (duhh)
found the vib square yet though.  Killing the wiz occasionally hasn't been
a problem, but it's getting to be a hassle having my shit randomly cursed
(i presume the book does that?).

What items would you recommend for my run for the amulet and for my run
for the endgame?  Should I prepare for the endgame before I go for the
amulet?

Do I have to take my gold out with me to get points for it, or can
i leave it in my chest?  Is it to my advantage to arrange for the
priest who has ~50k of my gold to have an accident so i can carry that
gold out?  

can i level teleport into the endgame once i've been there?  I'm thinking
of going into the endgame, clearing it out, level teleporting out to 
my chest, and then teleporting back with a load of gems.  

I'm thinking piles of blank blessed and cursed (any reason to leave any
uncursed?) scrolls, and a bunch of magic markers.  I do have my WoW with
4 or 5 charges left in case i get in a fix.  I also have two spare amulets
of life saving, a couple spare rings of teleport control (never got the
intrinsic), two blessed scrolls of genocide (would genociding elementals
be a good idea?).  

A bunch of holy and unholy water seems like a good idea too.

anything else I'm missing?

